, foundation-registry unification, C8 Freeze, publication/Official grant, canonical merge or deployment. Trusted synthetic authority configuration is external to untrusted attempt specs; privileged authority replacement/deletion is outside the protocol threat model.\n\nBRANCH_STATE: descriptor and diagnostics synthetically verified, exact675 published with8/8 final workflowsSUCCESS. INTEGRATION_STATE: Draft proposal atop exactPR30/86ad, not merged. CANONICAL_STATE: unchanged b8e39a2196a6d7794a04a0cd5393c68329e126ca. C8 remains SYNTHETIC_VERIFIED / NOT_FROZEN.\n\n\nGlobal read-only reconciliation: current6dedaaf36a417e9301ba22ea9595bff5f37acb38 CDR006-009 preserves Codex implementation ownership and Claude integration-owner read-only review; no shared Global write by Codex. External PR32/33 are separate owner evidence proposals and are not included in this green675 source. Final scoped handoff and portable Actions evidence are prepared for audit PR28; their publication is pending under implementation/docs/codex_takeover/CHECKPOINT_2026-10-03_GSUP_V2_SOURCE_IDENTITY.md.\n","created_at":"2026-10-03T07:32:27Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T07:56:30Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"547676da75308b02a35f9cef1b5be3b028bdf101","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kco994553-star/Investment-System1/pulls/31/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kco994553-star/Investment-System1/pulls/31/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kco994553-star/Investment-System1/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kco994553-star/Investment-System1/issues/31/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kco994553-star/Investment-System1/statuses/675d0d298fbaab5b8473ed048a561ef84e2f3e78","head":{"label":"kco994553-star:codex/track-c-gsup-v2-2026-10-03","ref":"codex/track-c-gsup-v2-2026-1